{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 18, :comments ["<b>And you shall dwell securely</b> — בטח (secure) by א\"ת ב\"ש (at-bash) equals שנ\"ס (262); equal to the count when the House stood and they dwelt securely:"], :book :leviticus, :voice :baal-haturim, :lang :en, :chapter 25, :notes {0 "The notation שנ\"ס likely abbreviates שיעור נ\"ס or a similar formula indicating a numerical reckoning; the at-bash of בטח (bet→shin, tav→shin, khet→samekh) = ששס = 262. The second שנ\"ס appears to introduce a parallel statement about the standing Temple."}, :source-witnesses [["On Your Way" "http://mobile.tora.ws/"]], :timestamp "2026-07-12T19:20:33.088368479Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}